                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I do wish games like this wouldn't get just left to rot when they are one of the only games in that category.\n\nI love this game and after getting a steam deck hoped it would be fun to play on it but due to the obvious lack of controller support it just feels kind of awkward.\n\nLike I said there are next to no Mahjong games on steam, the others seeming sketchy anyway. It would be great if a game like this made the effort to update what was necessary to support newer devices that can access the platform they are selling the product on.\n\nMaybe in the future but right now it doesn't seem like that will happen",
